## Key Fixes Applied

### AI SDK v6 Migration (app/api/)
- `parameters:` → `inputSchema:` in all `tool()` definitions
- `maxTokens:` → `maxOutputTokens:` in `generateText()`
- `maxSteps:` → `stopWhen: stepCountIs(N)` in `streamText()`
- `toDataStreamResponse()` → `toTextStreamResponse()`
- `usage.promptTokens` → `usage.inputTokens`, `completionTokens` → `outputTokens`
- Added explicit type annotations to all `execute:` destructured params

### Admin Settings Page (app/[locale]/admin/settings/page.tsx)
- Added generics to all `useState` calls (`useState<any[]>([])`, `useState<any>(null)`, etc.)
- Added `: string`, `: any`, `: boolean` to all callback params
- Cast `params.section` to `string`
- Cast `TRIGGER_TYPE_TO_SCHEMA` to `any` for dynamic index access
- Cast `.delete()` args and `.create()`/`.update()` with extra fields to `any`
- Added `unitId`/`cohortId` props to providers

### Test Files
- `ComponentTreeStore.test.ts` — `new Promise<void>()` fix
- `LogViewer.test.tsx` — added `stack: null` to mock objects
- `recordingStudioPresets.test.ts` — added `: any` to all result variables
- `gamificationActions.test.ts` — added mock exports + `as any` on dynamic imports
- `gamificationContext.test.tsx` — changed array type to `{ type: any; payload: any }`

### App Pages
- `WorkbookClient.tsx` — cast `questionBank as any`
- `content-completion/route.ts` — `toTextStreamResponse()`

